---
import Base from '../layouts/Base.astro';
import HandwrittenLabel from '../components/HandwrittenLabel.astro';
import Nav from '../components/Nav.astro';
---

<Base home={true}>
  <div class="readme" tabindex="0" aria-label="README">
    <span class="readme-link">README</span>
    <div class="readme-panel" role="note">
      <p>
        Another self-important faux-minimalist portfolio, you’re thinking, and I’m afraid you’re quite right.
        I felt the same way when I set out on the purposeful purported purposiveness without purpose<sup>1</sup>
        of siphoning some of my thoughts and work into a few pages of HTML for others to enjoy.
        Adorno and Horkheimer float to the surface of my mind as I write this, and I see plainly that this is
        an affirmative endeavour, a libation poured to the labor market, that most capricious of gods.
        But I choose this form nonetheless; this is me as Dasein doing my primordial historizing;<sup>2</sup>
        I have inherited this form, and I choose it. <em>Gleichwohl gewählt</em> as it were.
      </p>
      <p class="footnote">
        <sup>1</sup> Immanuel Kant, <cite>Critique of the Power of Judgment</cite>, §15 (<em>Zweckmäßigkeit ohne Zweck</em>).
      </p>
      <p class="footnote">
        <sup>2</sup> Martin Heidegger, <cite>Sein und Zeit</cite>, §74 (<em>Die Grundverfassung der Geschichtlichkeit</em>).
      </p>
    </div>
  </div>

  <section class="hero">
    <h1 class="name"><HandwrittenLabel asset="elisa-diop-weyer" label="Elisa Diop-Weyer" /></h1>
    <Nav morph={true} />
  </section>
</Base>

<style>
  /* home owns the full viewport -- no outer main padding */
  :global(main) {
    padding: 0;
  }

  .readme {
    position: absolute;
    top: 1.5rem;
    left: var(--pad);
    z-index: 10;
    outline: none;
  }

  .readme-link {
    text-decoration: underline;
    text-underline-offset: 2px;
    text-decoration-thickness: 1px;
    cursor: help;
    line-height: 1.5;
  }
  .readme:hover .readme-link,
  .readme:focus-visible .readme-link {
    opacity: 0.55;
  }

  .readme-panel {
    position: absolute;
    top: calc(1.5rem + 0.5rem);
    left: 0;
    width: min(32rem, calc(100vw - 2 * var(--pad)));
    padding: 1.2rem 1.4rem;
    background: var(--bg);
    border: 1px solid rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.18);
    line-height: 1.5;
    opacity: 0;
    visibility: hidden;
    transform: translateY(-4px);
    transition: opacity 0.22s ease, transform 0.22s ease, visibility 0.22s;
    pointer-events: none;
  }
  .readme:hover .readme-panel,
  .readme:focus-within .readme-panel {
    opacity: 1;
    visibility: visible;
    transform: translateY(0);
    pointer-events: auto;
  }

  .readme-panel p {
    margin: 0;
  }
  .readme-panel sup {
    font-size: 0.75em;
    vertical-align: super;
    line-height: 0;
  }
  .footnote {
    margin-top: 0.9rem !important;
    color: var(--muted);
    font-size: 0.9em;
  }
  .footnote cite {
    font-style: italic;
  }

  @media (prefers-reduced-motion: reduce) {
    .readme-panel {
      transition: none;
    }
  }

  .hero {
    min-height: 100vh;
    min-height: 100dvh;
    display: flex;
    flex-direction: column;
    align-items: center;
    justify-content: center;
    gap: 1.6rem;
    text-align: center;
    padding: var(--pad);
  }

  .name {
    font-weight: 400;
    font-size: 1rem;
  }

  /* on the home hub the nav stacks vertically and centers (matches the deck) */
  .hero :global(.nav) {
    flex-direction: column;
    gap: 0.45rem;
    align-items: center;
  }
</style>
